<title>FRANCE: France reports free-mkt wheat, barley, rye bids.</title>
<headline>France reports free-mkt wheat, barley, rye bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exporters made the following bids for refunds to export free-market wheat at this week's EU tender, French cereals office ONIC said. Bids are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Nov 21 ---		 --- Nov 14---</p>
<p>		 Tonnage   Range of Bids    Tonnage  Range of bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat  554,800   14.43-24.00	552,500   12.87-22.00</p>
<p> Barley	313,000   31.39-34.58	394,000   30.95-35.67</p>
<p> Rye	     4,000   Not given	    5,000   31.85-34.85</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
